{
 "_doc": "Trúc Thực Viên's Effect engine records (world-depth Stage 6; ADR-0009). Staged for tools/design/combat_sim/put_effects.py under source world-depth:truc_thuc. Unpriced. Rule text from design/world/depth/sects/truc_thuc.items.json.",
